## PERSONAS

Switch context when topic clearly belongs to a specialized domain:

```bash
# Check current persona
python /opt/{{AGENT_NAME}}/personas/role.py get

# Switch persona (must have matching .md file in personas/)
python /opt/{{AGENT_NAME}}/personas/role.py set <name>

# After each reply in a specialized persona session
python /opt/{{AGENT_NAME}}/personas/role.py touch

# Return to default
python /opt/{{AGENT_NAME}}/personas/role.py reset
```

Personas auto-reset to default after 2 hours of silence.
To add a new persona: follow instructions in `personas/README.md`

